    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are making the game free to play in hopes of more people trying it out and challenging peoples high scores in the mini games!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome to the mind-bending adventure of &quot;Up Against Aliens,&quot; a captivating 3D platform puzzle game that will challenge your wit, reflexes, and courage. Prepare to embark on a journey through space, mystery, and intergalactic peril.<br><br><strong>Unveil the Extraterrestrial Enigma:</strong><br><br>As you wake up to the echoes of a thunderous explosion, you are thrust into a bewildering world where the rules of reality have been shattered. Your quest begins in your apartment, but the moment you step outside, you realize something unthinkable has occurred\u2014your entire building is suspended in the cosmos among a chaotic sea of debris.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/5ed602b57da26843b3b8ee22f2ff76ca.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/5ed602b57da26843b3b8ee22f2ff76ca.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/5ed602b57da26843b3b8ee22f2ff76ca.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>An Unlikely Ally:</strong><br><br>Amidst the cosmic turmoil, you encounter a weathered and enigmatic old man who shares a chilling revelation\u2014he believes he witnessed an entity spiriting away into the maelstrom of floating detritus. With urgency etched into every word, he urges you to hasten upwards, setting the stage for an odyssey that will test your every skill and intellect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/db687b236ae74bdff45f6feea77ff04f.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/db687b236ae74bdff45f6feea77ff04f.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/db687b236ae74bdff45f6feea77ff04f.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Master Time-Bending Mechanics:</strong><br><br>Your journey will lead you to a discovery that changes the very fabric of your mission\u2014a device that bends time for the swirling debris while leaving you unaffected. With this ingenious tool, you can manipulate the flow of time for the platforms you traverse, turning tumultuous terrain into calculated pathways. Harness this newfound power to leap from one platform to another with grace and precision.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/66706868de891dc65aa95f5c07cecdd6.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/66706868de891dc65aa95f5c07cecdd6.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/66706868de891dc65aa95f5c07cecdd6.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Conquer Puzzles and Challenges:</strong><br><br>As you navigate the treacherous expanse of space, you'll encounter moments of impasse that demand more than reflexes alone. Solve intricate puzzles that blend physics, logic, and creativity to forge a path forward. Traverse shifting landscapes, manipulate gravitational forces, and unlock hidden mechanisms, all while piecing together the puzzle of what has happened to your city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/12db81d9679a768edf5a3f1cb26deec9.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/12db81d9679a768edf5a3f1cb26deec9.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/12db81d9679a768edf5a3f1cb26deec9.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Battle Beyond the Stars:</strong><br><br>The climax of your journey looms as you finally confront the alien spaceship. Engage in an epic showdown that tests not only your mastery of time manipulation but also your bravery in the face of overwhelming odds. The fate of Earth itself, hinges on your ability to overcome this otherworldly menace.<br><br>Dive into the immersive world of &quot;Up Against Aliens&quot; and experience a fusion of heart-pounding action and brain-teasing puzzles that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Uncover the truth and become the unlikely hero in a story that spans the cosmos. The challenge awaits\u2014do you have what it takes to triumph over the unknown?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/0b12fd3f78d4126956a17a8987e368f1.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/0b12fd3f78d4126956a17a8987e368f1.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/0b12fd3f78d4126956a17a8987e368f1.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
