eam/apps/2550660/extras/db687b236ae74bdff45f6feea77ff04f.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/db687b236ae74bdff45f6feea77ff04f.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Master Time-Bending Mechanics:</strong><br><br>Your journey will lead you to a discovery that changes the very fabric of your mission\u2014a device that bends time for the swirling debris while leaving you unaffected. With this ingenious tool, you can manipulate the flow of time for the platforms you traverse, turning tumultuous terrain into calculated pathways. Harness this newfound power to leap from one platform to another with grace and precision.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/66706868de891dc65aa95f5c07cecdd6.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/66706868de891dc65aa95f5c07cecdd6.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/66706868de891dc65aa95f5c07cecdd6.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Conquer Puzzles and Challenges:</strong><br><br>As you navigate the treacherous expanse of space, you'll encounter moments of impasse that demand more than reflexes alone. Solve intricate puzzles that blend physics, logic, and creativity to forge a path forward. Traverse shifting landscapes, manipulate gravitational forces, and unlock hidden mechanisms, all while piecing together the puzzle of what has happened to your city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/12db81d9679a768edf5a3f1cb26deec9.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/12db81d9679a768edf5a3f1cb26deec9.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/12db81d9679a768edf5a3f1cb26deec9.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Battle Beyond the Stars:</strong><br><br>The climax of your journey looms as you finally confront the alien spaceship. Engage in an epic showdown that tests not only your mastery of time manipulation but also your bravery in the face of overwhelming odds. The fate of Earth itself, hinges on your ability to overcome this otherworldly menace.<br><br>Dive into the immersive world of &quot;Up Against Aliens&quot; and experience a fusion of heart-pounding action and brain-teasing puzzles that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Uncover the truth and become the unlikely hero in a story that spans the cosmos. The challenge awaits\u2014do you have what it takes to triumph over the unknown?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/0b12fd3f78d4126956a17a8987e368f1.poster.avif?t=1745498144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/0b12fd3f78d4126956a17a8987e368f1.webm?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550660/extras/0b12fd3f78d4126956a17a8987e368f1.mp4?t=1745498144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
